      "source": "Update object representing a set of update operations. <a href=\"Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a> objects can be created in a fluent style. Each\nconstruction operation creates a new immutable <a href=\"Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a> object.\n\n<pre class=\"code\">Update update = Update.empty().set(\"foo\", \"bar\").addTo(\"baz\").prependAll(listOfValues);\n</pre>",
      "translation": "更新代表一组更新操作的对象。<a href=\"Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a> 对象可以以流式风格创建。每个构建操作都会创建一个新的不可变 <a href=\"Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a> 对象。\n\n<pre class=\"code\">Update update = Update.empty().set(\"foo\", \"bar\").addTo(\"baz\").prependAll(listOfValues);\n</pre>",
      "count": 1
    },
